          "path": "_m/w/e/c/p/tuen-mun-park-wp/tiny-dancer-7078687981.jpg",
          "filename": "Tiny dancer (7078687981).jpg",
          "caption": "In Tuen Mun park there are several areas where people set up with a singer and a keyboardist and sing songs. folks would gather around musical act and dance in a semi-choreographed looking way. it was unclear to me how any one dance troupe paired up with any specific singer. people would tip the singer, but not the dancer. it was definitely a trip as there were about half a dozen of these scenes through the fairly small park. This kid kind of photobombed my shot of the singer and dancers, but I dig it.",
          "alt": "In Tuen Mun park there are several areas where people set up with a singer and a keyboardist and sing songs. folks would gather around musical act and dance in a semi-choreographed looking way. it was unclear to me how any one dance troupe paired up with any specific singer. people would tip the singer, but not the dancer. it was definitely a trip as there were about half a dozen of these scenes through the fairly small park. This kid kind of photobombed my shot of the singer and dancers, but I dig it.",
